<h1>Roadmap</h1>

<p class="lead">GatherPack is in active development with a visible plan. We split <strong>Available now</strong> from <strong>On the roadmap</strong> confidently — no asterisk footnotes, no apology. Check back here for dated updates; <code>last updated</code> is <time datetime="2026-09-17">September 17, 2026</time>.</p>

<p class="small text-muted">How to read: <strong>Available now</strong> ships today; <strong>Next</strong> is intentional and dated next; <strong>Later</strong> is planned with clear dependencies. All use <code>&lt;time datetime=""&gt;</code> for freshness signals and <code>article:published_time</code>/<code>modified_time</code> in the head.</p>

<section id="available-now" class="card" aria-labelledby="available-now-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="available-now-heading">Available now</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <h3 class="h5"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success" aria-hidden="true"></i> Members &amp; roster</h3>
        <ul class="mb-0">
          <li>Member management — roster, teams, managers, badges</li>
          <li>Hierarchy and role scoping per team</li>
          <li>Family/relationship links, dietary, shirt sizes, custom fields</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-0 mt-2"><a href="/features/members/">Members details →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <h3 class="h5"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success" aria-hidden="true"></i> Events &amp; time tracking</h3>
        <ul class="mb-0">
          <li>Team-scoped calendar, RSVP, custom fields, shifts &amp; check-in</li>
          <li>Kiosk with PIN/barcode/RFID, multiple periods, bulk clock-out</li>
          <li>Calendar UI today; sync on the roadmap (see Next)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-0 mt-2"><a href="/features/events/">Events details →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <h3 class="h5"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success" aria-hidden="true"></i> Finance</h3>
        <ul class="mb-0">
          <li>Ledger, tagged transactions, receipts &amp; invoices</li>
          <li>Stripe payments — cards, bank transfer, and more today</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-0 mt-2"><a href="/features/finance/">Finance details →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <h3 class="h5"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success" aria-hidden="true"></i> Communication</h3>
        <ul class="mb-0">
          <li>Team-scoped announcements with scheduled publish/expire</li>
          <li>Email summaries (digest) and immediate push for urgent posts</li>
          <li>Content pages for handbooks and persistent resources</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-0 mt-2"><a href="/features/communication/">Communication details →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12">
        <h3 class="h5"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success" aria-hidden="true"></i> Automation</h3>
        <ul class="mb-0">
          <li>Custom reports (code-snippet based) over roster/attendance/finance</li>
          <li>Period-based attendance and volunteer-hours reporting</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small text-muted mb-0 mt-2"><a href="/features/automation/">Automation &amp; reports →</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mt-3 mb-0 small text-muted">All “Available now” items are running in production for two orgs live, six evaluating — same live-fire expectations we hold for hosting reliability.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="next" class="card" aria-labelledby="next-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="next-heading">Next <span class="badge bg-warning text-dark ms-2">Fall 2026</span></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>These are the confident next steps — intentionally next, with scope and target quarter visible. They reuse the <em>Coming Soon</em> badges that used to be footnoted on the homepage (<code>src/index.erb:178,188,221,230</code>).</p>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <h3 class="h5">Communication</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Multi-channel messaging — text, Slack, Discord</li>
          <li>Notifications for RSVPs, payments, new members</li>
          <li>Unified notifications center with per-member channel prefs</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small text-muted">Target: <time datetime="2026-10">October 2026</time>. Tracked issue: <a href="https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <h3 class="h5">Automation</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Actions — user-triggered custom tasks scoped to a team</li>
          <li>Hooks — automatic logic on system events (member joined, payment landed)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small text-muted">Target: <time datetime="2026-11">November 2026</time>. No-code report builder follows hooks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <h3 class="h5">Calendar</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Google Calendar sync (display) — the most-requested integration (<code>src/index.erb:97</code> TODO)</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small text-muted">Target: <time datetime="2026-10">October 2026</time>.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <h3 class="h5">Finance</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Additional rails triage — Zeffy, PayPal, Venmo</li>
          <li>Automatic bank-pull transaction import</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="small text-muted">Target: <time datetime="2026-11">November 2026</time> for triage; import in early 2027.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="/updates/roadmap-fall-2026/">See the Fall 2026 roadmap post →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="later" class="card" aria-labelledby="later-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="later-heading">Later</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Planned with clear intent but without a hard date — dependencies or scoping still in flight.</p>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <h3 class="h5">Organization</h3>
        <ul class="mb-0">
          <li>Titles &amp; org charts (<code>src/first-teams.erb:34</code> carry-over)</li>
          <li>No-code report builder for non-technical leaders</li>
          <li>Fiscal sponsorship option for groups without a bank account (hosted path)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
        <h3 class="h5">Platform</h3>
        <ul class="mb-0">
          <li>Deeper org-chart-aware scheduling</li>
          <li>Requirements before check-in (eligibility gates)</li>
          <li>Attendance notifications (missing check-in, etc.)</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="small text-muted mt-3 mb-0">Every Later item originated as a “Coming Soon” or TODO in the prior single-page site; we keep them visible with context instead of hiding gaps.</p>
  </div>
</section>

